  "title": "Seven Layer Magic Bars",
  "description": "There's no mixing involved in this easy bar cookie--just layers of buttery graham cracker crumbs, chocolate and butterscotch chips, nuts, coconut, and sweetened condensed milk baked into a rich dessert treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie Phillips"
  ],
